 ignore_unavailable=true. Supply the referenced parameter, so this tests boolean parsing, not missing-variable behavior."],"native_plan":["Reuse each ready exact main/image; no new index, data write, stored script, auth, private or paid operation.","Five POST requests: option omitted, lowercase true, lowercase false, uppercase TRUE and invalid not-a-bool. Expect all five accepted on9.2; on9.3 expect first three200 and uppercase/invalid400. Accepted cases must have empty hits and score0.","Commit producer and source plan before HTTP; preserve bounded replies and immutable attempts. Validate exact image/version provenance, source SHA, actual headers, statuses and error type/reason."],"limitations":["Only these five literal option values and one public rank-template path; missing-variable behavior, all boolean consumers and render endpoint completeness remain open."]},"primary_sources":[{"path":"modules/lang-mustache/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/script/mustache/RestRenderSearchTemplateAction.java","source_commit":"cdb2d7a7a46dfe4ef7c3f859b94fb86ba8e652e1","local_source":"docs/research/source-analysis/9.2.8/mustache-boolean-option-sources/RestRenderSearchTemplateAction.java","sha256":"c5ec5ff0ad613b8a9bf290345c486a7caed1747d9f6e2cf2f0f3fd28924aadc0","git_blob":"72c1bcf1390e7263ddc81842b4f3e66786f612f3","url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/cdb2d7a7a46dfe4ef7c3f859b94fb86ba8e652e1/modules/lang-mustache/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/script/mustache/RestRenderSearchTemplateAction.java","retained_url":"primary-sources/c5ec5ff0ad613b8a9bf290345c486a7caed1747d9f6e2cf2f0f3fd28924aadc0-RestRenderSearchTemplateAction.java"},{"path":"modules/lang-mustache/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/script/mustache/TransportSearchTemplateAction.java","source_commit":"cdb2d7a7a46dfe4ef7c3f859b94fb86ba8e652e1","local_source":"docs/research/source-analysis/9.2.8/mustache-boolean-option-sources/TransportSearchTemplateAction.java","sha256":"f4a70ce3b342bf715a4928d49868821d1a2a1